OL,3,ANigerian attempts to break world record
OL,4,Aby dancing non-stop for seven days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nigerian dancer is attempting to
OL,7,Fdance non-stop for seven days in order
OL,8,Fto set a new world record.
OL,10,FBenjamin Daniel, known as Ben Dancer,
OL,11,Fis aiming to dance for 168 hours - 41
OL,12,Fhours longer than the current record
OL,13,Ffor the longest individual dance
OL,14,Fmarathon.
OL,16,FGuinness World Records has yet to
OL,17,Fconfirm whether the attempt qualifies
OL,18,Fas an official record. The BBC has
OL,19,Fcontacted the organisation for comment.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
