OL,3,ANigerian attempts to break world record
OL,4,Aby dancing non-stop for seven days
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people have been gathering in
OL,7,Frecent days to cheer him on at Freedom
OL,8,FPark in Lagos, filming his every move
OL,9,Fand dancing along from behind the
OL,10,Fbarriers.
